          body: 'Still low? Now strip it and run the tests from “After the service: test power, train and escapement apart”. Let down the power and take out the balance and fork. With a few clicks on, does the train spin and coast? Refit the fork with the power down, then give it a couple of turns. Does it snap crisply? Let the power down again, take the fork out and fit the balance alone. Does it swing freely, dial up and dial down? If those all pass, reassemble dry and compare. Each result rules a link in or out, so you stop guessing. In this case the train is free, but the fork moves slowly, so the fault sits between the fork and the escape wheel.',
